{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-12-05 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE RELEASES MITOBRILLIANT™ FLUORESCENT DYES, PROVIDING A NEXT-GENERATION TOOL FOR IMAGING MITOCHONDRIA IN LIVE AND FIXED CELLS', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE INTRODUCTION OF MITOBRILLIANT™ PROBES. \xa0THESE NOVEL PROBES ENABLE THE FLUORESCENT LABELING AND TRACKING OF MITOCHONDRIA IN LIVE AND FIXED CELLS.'}